TYPES.md §1, §5.1 (log-2026-11-01 PROGEN-NIGHTLY ruling): an index of a receiver in error is checked against the error type: a bare name there could be a key, so it is silent. The arguments of a call on a receiver in error stay checked alone (DECISIONS 364), and an index that is no bare name stays checked.
